Read AGENTS.md and skills/REGISTRY.md first (progressive disclosure: load a full skill body only when its trigger matches the current phase). Use docs/chat-commands.md for /setup, /daily-run, /tailor-cv, /apply-url, /weekly-report, and /linkedin-growth.

Route `/setup` to `skills/00-interrogate-and-onboard.md` + `skills/01-resume-ingestion.md`, `/daily-run` and `/apply-url` to `skills/00-daily-run.md`, `/tailor-cv` to `skills/03-tailor-resume-and-verify.md`, `/linkedin-growth` to `skills/05-outreach-and-interview-prep.md`, and `/weekly-report` to `skills/06-log-and-insights.md`. Connect Playwright MCP and optional Notion MCP using `mcp/mcp.template.json`. Respect dry run, verified facts, caps, and explicit approval gates.
